Z||000000||Greg Piet||01-10-2001||04:43 AM||||Trying to put my fancy fancy front springs in, but also wanted to put in the negative camber fixing bushings...<P>I cant get those friggin ball joints off.<P>I made up a tool like the one in the GM manual that expands between the ball joint bolts, but no luck (I tightened the heck out of it).<P>I am a grumpy guy... Mainly just venting!||||reg||1
Z||000001||bHooper||01-10-2001||07:07 AM||||Greg, you 've gotta keep turning, and eventually they will pop, one at a time.<P>I have only done one car, so I am no expert.  But that's what I couild tell... turn baby, turn!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
